{
  "uid": "agent-observatory-overview",
  "title": "Agent Observatory — Overview",
  "tags": ["agent-observatory"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 1,
  "refresh": "10s",
  "time": { "from": "now-6h", "to": "now" },
  "templating": {
    "list": [
      {
        "name": "runtime",
        "label": "Runtime",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(observatory_runs_total, runtime)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      },
      {
        "name": "variant",
        "label": "Variant",
        "type": "query",
        "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
        "query": "label_values(observatory_runs_total, variant)",
        "includeAll": true,
        "multi": true,
        "current": { "text": "All", "value": "$__all" }
      }
    ]
  },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "barchart",
      "title": "1 — Runs by runtime",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (runtime) (observatory_runs_total{runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "piechart",
      "title": "2 — Pass / fail",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 0 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (result) (observatory_runs_total{runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"})",
          "legendFormat": "{{result}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "3 — Median run duration",
      "description": "Wall-clock duration of the whole benchmark run, per variant.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": { "defaults": { "unit": "ms" }, "overrides": [] },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "observatory_run_duration{quantile=\"0.5\", runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}} / {{variant}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "4 — Median token count",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "observatory_run_tokens{quantile=\"0.5\", runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}} / {{variant}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "5 — Median tool calls",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 8 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "observatory_run_tool_calls{quantile=\"0.5\", runtime=~\"$runtime\", variant=~\"$variant\"}",
          "legendFormat": "{{runtime}} / {{variant}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "6 — Tool failure rate",
      "description": "Failed tool executions divided by all tool executions.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percentunit",
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 0.1 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 0.25 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 16 },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(observatory_tool_failures_total{runtime=~\"$runtime\"}) / clamp_min(sum(observatory_run_tool_calls_sum{runtime=~\"$runtime\"}), 1)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "7 — Find an individual run trace",
      "gridPos": { "h": 6, "w": 16, "x": 8, "y": 16 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "Individual runs are inspected in **Tempo**, not rebuilt here (chapter 00 §19).\n\nOpen **Explore → Tempo → Search** and filter by the resource attribute the runner sets:\n\n```\n{ resource.observatory.run.id = \"<run id>\" }\n```\n\nUseful follow-ups:\n\n```\n{ resource.benchmark.id = \"BE-001\" }\n{ resource.experiment.variant = \"baseline\" }\n{ name = \"execute_tool\" && status = error }\n```\n\nThe Observatory UI links straight here from each run detail page."
      }
    }
  ]
}
